OL,3,GNEWSADeputy head hopes poker will boost
OL,4,Apension
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'd never played before, did not know
OL,7,Fwhat I was doing and I had beginner's
OL,8,Fluck because I actually won the whole
OL,9,Ftournament and ever since I've been
OL,10,Fhooked," she explained.
